TWO FILES IN THIS PROJECT ARE UNMODIFIED RECORDED GAMEPLAY VIDEO, not model output:
data/first_frame_ref.mp4 and data/demo/aligned_ref.mp4. The observation model is
conditioned on a reference frame and these supply it. They are short clips from the
same recordings the corpus was built from, and they are covered by the terms above.
Everything else covered by this licence -- seed states, scanned height fields, pose
videos, rollouts and gallery stills -- is numeric derivation or model output.
